\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3.</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div></div>",
